OL,3,AOompa Loompa, doompety done: Actor
OL,4,Atakes final bow
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn original Oompa Loompa actor from the
OL,7,F1971 film Willy Wonka & the Chocolate
OL,8,FFactory has retired after reprising the
OL,9,Frole one final time.
OL,11,FRusty Goffe began his film career in
OL,12,Fthe Gene Wilder movie, before later
OL,13,Fappearing in the original Star Wars,
OL,14,Fthe Harry Potter films and Doctor Who.
OL,16,FLast year, Netflix flew the 77-year-old
OL,17,Ffrom his home in Leighton Buzzard,
OL,18,FBedfordshire, to Brisbane, Australia,
OL,19,Fwhere he once again donned a green wig
OL,20,Fand overalls for the TV competition
OL,21,FWonka's The Golden Ticket.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,172,160,200,105,0,100
