OL,3,AOompa Loompa, doompety done: Actor
OL,4,Atakes final bow
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said: "I started on Willy Wonka &
OL,7,Fthe Chocolate Factory, and now Wonka's
OL,8,FThe Golden Ticket is my swan song. I've
OL,9,Fjust ended my career on Willy Wonka.
OL,10,FIsn't that wonderful?"
